{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/LibraryLogo_page.png?t=1744712930\" /><br>Step into the mystical world of <strong>Durga</strong>, a fearless <strong>teenager village girl</strong> on a journey of survival, discovery, and destiny. Set deep within the <strong>Indian forests</strong>, this <strong>story-driven RPG</strong> takes you on an emotional and adventurous quest, where ancient mythology meets real-life struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/for_GIF_3.gif?t=1744712930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/steam_Page_survive.png?t=1744712930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Unlock Chapters of the Past</strong> \u2013 Progress through <strong>one-by-one chapters</strong>, each revealing deeper connections to India\u2019s <strong>mythological heritage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Brave the Wild</strong> \u2013 Face <strong>lions and other wild animals</strong>, gather resources, and adapt to the untamed wilderness. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/for_GIF.gif?t=1744712930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udd38 <strong>Solve Mystical Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Find <strong>hidden objects</strong>, interact with villagers, and piece together the <strong>forgotten Puranic stories</strong>.<br>\ud83d\udd38 <strong>Discover Her Legacy</strong> \u2013 Witness Durga\u2019s transformation from a brave girl to a <strong>guardian of rituals and ancient wisdom</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a